FULLY BROKEN

Needs issues with html2gtk crate resolved:


Newsflash itself has a dependency on a crate html2gtk defined in its cargo file as:
---
[dependencies.html2gtk]
features = ["ratex", "video-thumbnails"]
git = "https://gitlab.com/news-flash/html2gtk.git"
--
This crate without any speciifed version breaks both url2pkg with
--
