    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  File "/usr/pkg/lib/python3.14/subprocess.py", line 420, in check_call
    raise CalledProcessError(retcode, cmd)
subprocess.CalledProcessError: Command '['/usr/bin/make', 'distinfo']' returned non-zero exit status 1.
--
and the structure of cargo-depends.mk doesn't have an obvious solution I can see for this.

lang/rust/cargo.mk seems to list this as a TODO thing?
